  "job_B1.8.4.4_20251001_193259": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00feam Syndon swa \u00feeah gesette o\u00f0re bec \u00f0urh halige lareowas, \u00fee man h\u00e6f\u00f0 wide gehw\u00e6r on cristendome & seo sixte yld \u00feissere worulde stynt fram Criste astreht o\u00fe domes d\u00e6g eallum mannum ungewiss, ac Seo seofo\u00f0e yld ys \u00fee yrn\u00f0 mid \u00feisum sixum fram Abele \u00feam rihtwisan o\u00f0 \u00feissere worulde ende, na Seo eahteo\u00f0e yld ys se an eca d\u00e6g \u00e6fter urum \u00e6riste, \u00feonne we rixia\u00f0 mid Gode on sawle & on Hu m\u00e6g se man wel faran, \u00f0e his mod awent fram eallum \u00feisum bocum & bi\u00f0 him swa anwille, \u00fe\u00e6t Moyses us l\u00e6rde, se m\u00e6ra witega, on his gesetnissum \u00feus secgende eallum: Interroga patrem tuum & Gif \u00feu nelt witan & beon gewissod her, \u00feu scealt leornian \u00f0\u00e6r \u00fee la\u00fere bi\u00f0 on egeslicum witum, \u00f0\u00e6t Witan sceoldon smeagan mid wislicum ge\u00feeahte, \u00feonne on mancinne to micel yfel bi\u00f0, hwilc \u00fe\u00e6ra Se cinestol stynt on \u00feisum \u00ferim stelum: laboratores, bellatores, oratores. Laboratores sind \u00fee us bigleofan tilia\u00f0, yr\u00f0lingas & \u00e6htemen to \u00feam anum bet\u00e6hte. Oratores syndon \u00fee us \u00feingia\u00f0 to Gode & cristendom fyr\u00f0ria\u00f0 on cristenum folcum on Godes Bellatores sindon \u00fee ure burga healda\u00f0 & eac urne eard, wi\u00f0 \u00feone sigendne here feohtende mid He ys Godes \u00feen \u00fee sylfum to \u00feearfe on \u00f0am yfelum wyrcendum to wr\u00e6ce gesett.",
